<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1433807199"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1535586576"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Set Free"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Cloudier"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Set Free"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:54.430"><div begin="00:46.670" end="03:54.430"><p begin="00:46.670" end="00:50.270" itunes:key="L1">I look to the unknown<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我放眼望向未知</span></p><p begin="00:50.270" end="00:53.880" itunes:key="L2">With nothing, no one to hold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只身一无所有</span></p><p begin="00:53.880" end="00:56.530" itunes:key="L3">Within a broken world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这崩坏的世界中</span></p><p begin="00:56.530" end="00:59.830" itunes:key="L4">I found a fire in my soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烈焰于灵魂深处燃起</span></p><p begin="00:59.830" end="01:01.380" itunes:key="L5">I can't stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能阻挡</span></p><p begin="01:01.380" end="01:03.060" itunes:key="L6">No I can't stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法压制</span></p><p begin="01:03.060" end="01:05.720" itunes:key="L7">This burning desire within me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心那灼烧的渴望</span></p><p begin="01:05.720" end="01:07.770" itunes:key="L8">I'll never falter<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝不战栗</span></p><p begin="01:07.770" end="01:09.520" itunes:key="L9">I'll never fall<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不倒下</span></p><p begin="01:09.520" end="01:14.410" itunes:key="L10">Because I want to be free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因我欲追寻我的自由</span></p><p begin="01:44.160" end="01:48.200" itunes:key="L11">There I found you all alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在迷茫中我看见了孤寂的你</span></p><p begin="01:48.200" end="01:52.070" itunes:key="L12">With nothing, no one to hold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只身一无所有</span></p><p begin="01:52.070" end="01:54.830" itunes:key="L13">Within this broken world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这崩坏的世界中</span></p><p begin="01:54.830" end="01:59.560" itunes:key="L14">You gave me a hand to hold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你向我伸出了手</span></p><p begin="01:59.560" end="02:03.260" itunes:key="L15">So come with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就与我同行吧</span></p><p begin="02:03.260" end="02:06.910" itunes:key="L16">If we believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要相信</span></p><p begin="02:06.910" end="02:12.700" itunes:key="L17">We're what we want to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我天生注定</span></p><p begin="02:12.700" end="02:14.630" itunes:key="L18">Cause you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有你我相伴</span></p><p begin="02:14.630" end="02:16.130" itunes:key="L19">Yeah we're gonna break free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们方能打破枷锁</span></p><p begin="02:16.130" end="02:18.170" itunes:key="L20">Oh, everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有的平行世界</span></p><p begin="02:18.170" end="02:19.520" itunes:key="L21">Has finally come down to this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都于此刻收束</span></p><p begin="02:19.520" end="02:21.830" itunes:key="L22">So, can you see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那你可否预见</span></p><p begin="02:21.830" end="02:23.440" itunes:key="L23">Yeah we're gonna break free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重归自由的你和我</span></p><p begin="02:23.440" end="02:27.030" itunes:key="L24">So just believe in me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就请相信于我</span></p><p begin="02:27.030" end="02:29.090" itunes:key="L25">Cause you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有你我同行</span></p><p begin="02:29.090" end="02:30.590" itunes:key="L26">Yeah we're gonna break free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们终将重归自由</span></p><p begin="02:30.590" end="02:32.690" itunes:key="L27">Oh everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命中注定的一切</span></p><p begin="02:32.690" end="02:34.260" itunes:key="L28">Has finally come down to this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在此刻兑现</span></p><p begin="02:34.260" end="02:36.360" itunes:key="L29">So can you see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那你可否见证</span></p><p begin="02:36.360" end="02:38.030" itunes:key="L30">Yeah we're gonna break free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终归自由的你和我</span></p><p begin="02:38.030" end="02:41.640" itunes:key="L31">So just believe in me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就请相许于我</span></p><p begin="02:41.640" end="02:43.540" itunes:key="L32">Cause you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我手牵着手</span></p><p begin="02:43.540" end="02:46.920" itunes:key="L33">We can be together for eternity<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们可以相伴天长地久</span></p><p begin="02:46.920" end="02:48.970" itunes:key="L34">You know we're just meant to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请相信你我二人</span></p><p begin="02:48.970" end="02:50.980" itunes:key="L35">Oh, you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命中注定般配</span></p><p begin="02:50.980" end="02:52.700" itunes:key="L36">We will be together for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们心心相印</span></p><p begin="02:52.700" end="02:56.240" itunes:key="L37">As long as we can be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永世永生绝不分离❤</span></p><p begin="02:56.240" end="02:57.600" itunes:key="L38">I can't stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能阻挡</span></p><p begin="02:57.600" end="02:59.570" itunes:key="L39">No I can't stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法压制</span></p><p begin="02:59.570" end="03:02.760" itunes:key="L40">This burning desire within me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心那灼烧的渴望</span></p><p begin="03:02.760" end="03:09.270" itunes:key="L41">Oh, let the spark within our hearts ignite<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我们的爱情火花点亮一切！</span></p><p begin="03:39.670" end="03:41.870" itunes:key="L42">Cause you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我两手相牵</span></p><p begin="03:41.870" end="03:43.330" itunes:key="L43">Yeah we're gonna break free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们终将重归自由</span></p><p begin="03:43.330" end="03:45.100" itunes:key="L44">Oh, everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命中注定的所有</span></p><p begin="03:45.100" end="03:47.130" itunes:key="L45">Has finally come down to this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻得以兑现</span></p><p begin="03:47.130" end="03:48.900" itunes:key="L46">So, can you see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那你可否见证</span></p><p begin="03:48.900" end="03:50.620" itunes:key="L47">Yeah we're gonna break free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重回自由的你我</span></p><p begin="03:50.620" end="03:54.430" itunes:key="L48">So just believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就请相许于我</span></p></div></body></tt>